<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8315 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8315 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8315 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>					  March 6	    March 5</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8315	     1.8315</p>
<p> Volume traded			$1.37 million	  $14.83 million</p>
